# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:113
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sage:"
msgstr "संत:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:115
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sage is a free open-source mathematics software system licensed under the "
"GPL. It combines the power of many existing open-source packages, within a "
"common Python-based interface. See <ulink "
"url=\"https://sagemath.org\">https://sagemath.org</ulink> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Sage इति GPL इत्यस्य अन्तर्गतं अनुज्ञापत्रं प्राप्तं निःशुल्कं "
"मुक्त-स्रोत-गणित-सॉफ्टवेयर-प्रणाली अस्ति । एतत् अनेकानां विद्यमानानाम् "
"मुक्त-स्रोत-सङ्कुलानाम् शक्तिं संयोजयति, सामान्यस्य "
"पायथन्-आधारित-अन्तरफलकस्य अन्तः । अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://sagemath.org\">https://sagemath.org</ulink> इति पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:123
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maxima:"
msgstr "अधिकतमम् : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:125
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Maxima is a system for the manipulation of symbolic and numeric "
"expressions, including differentiation, integration, Taylor series, Laplace "
"transforms, ordinary differential equations, systems of linear equations, "
"polynomials, sets, lists, vectors, matrices, and tensors. Maxima yields "
"high-precision numeric results by using exact fractions, arbitrary "
"precision integers, and variable precision floating point numbers. Maxima "
"can plot functions and data in two and three dimensions. See <ulink "
"url=\"http://maxima.sourceforge.net\">http://maxima.sourceforge.net</ulink> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"मैक्सिमा प्रतीकात्मक-संख्यात्मक-व्यञ्जनानां हेरफेरस्य प्रणाली अस्ति, यत्र "
"भेदभावः, एकीकरणं, टेलर-श्रृङ्खला, लैप्लेस्-रूपान्तरणं, "
"साधारण-अवभेद-समीकरणानि, रेखीय-समीकरणानां, बहुपदानां, समुच्चयानां, सूचीनां, "
"सदिशानां, मैट्रिक्सस्य, टेन्सरस्य च प्रणाल्याः सन्ति अधिकतमं सटीक-अंशानां, "
"मनमाना-सटीकतापूर्ण-अङ्कानां, चर-सटीक-प्लवक-बिन्दु-सङ्ख्यानां च उपयोगेन "
"उच्च-सटीक-संख्यात्मक-परिणामान् ददाति । मैक्सिमा द्वयोः त्रयोः च आयामयोः "
"कार्याणि, दत्तांशं च प्लॉट् कर्तुं शक्नोति । अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"http://maxima.sourceforge.net\">http://maxima.sourceforge.net</ulink> "
"इति पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:137
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "<term>R:</term>"
msgstr "<term>R:</term> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:139
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"R is a language and environment for statistical computing and graphics, "
"similar to the S language and environment. It provides a wide variety of "
"statistical (linear and nonlinear modelling, classical statistical tests, "
"time-series analysis, classification, clustering, data science, ...) and "
"graphical techniques, and is highly extensible. The S language is often the "
"vehicle of choice for research in statistical methodology, and R provides "
"an open-source route to this. See <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.r-project.org\">https://www.r-project.org</ulink> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"R सांख्यिकीयगणनायाः चित्रलेखानां च भाषा वातावरणं च अस्ति, यत् S भाषायाः "
"वातावरणस्य च सदृशम् अस्ति । एतत् सांख्यिकीय-(रेखीय-अरेखीय-प्रतिरूपणं, "
"शास्त्रीय-सांख्यिकीय-परीक्षा, समय-श्रृङ्खला-विश्लेषणं, वर्गीकरणं, "
"समूहीकरणं, आँकडा-विज्ञानं, ...) तथा चित्रात्मक-तकनीकानां विस्तृतविविधतां "
"प्रदाति, तथा च अत्यन्तं विस्तारयोग्यम् अस्ति S भाषा प्रायः "
"सांख्यिकीयपद्धत्या अनुसन्धानार्थं पसन्दस्य वाहनं भवति, R अस्य कृते "
"मुक्त-स्रोतमार्गं प्रदाति । अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.r-project.org\">https://www.r-project.org</ulink> इति "
"पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:151
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Julia:"
msgstr "जूलिया : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:153
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Julia is a high-level, high-performance, general-purpose dynamic "
"programming language for technical computing, with syntax that is familiar "
"to users of other technical computing environments. It provides a "
"sophisticated compiler, distributed parallel execution, numerical accuracy, "
"and an extensive mathematical function library. See <ulink "
"url=\"https://julialang.org/\">Julia website</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"जूलिया तकनीकीगणनायाः कृते उच्चस्तरीयः, उच्चप्रदर्शनयुक्तः, "
"सामान्यप्रयोजनीयः गतिशीलप्रोग्रामिंगभाषा अस्ति, यस्य वाक्यविन्यासः अन्येषां "
"तकनीकीगणनावातावरणानां उपयोक्तृभ्यः परिचितः अस्ति एतत् परिष्कृतं संकलकं, "
"वितरितं समानान्तरनिष्पादनं, संख्यात्मकसटीकता, विस्तृतं "
"गणितीयकार्यपुस्तकालयं च प्रदाति । अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://julialang.org/\">जूलिया-जालस्थलं</ulink> पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:164
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kalgebra;:"
msgstr "& कैल्जीब्रा;:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:166
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalgebra; is a MathML-based graph calculator, that ships with &kde; "
"Education project. See <ulink "
"url=\"https://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/\">https://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/</ulink> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"&कलगेब्रा; एकः MathML-आधारितः आलेखगणकः अस्ति, यः &kde; शिक्षा परियोजना। "
"अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/\">https://edu.kde.org/kalgebra/</ulink> "
"इति पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:173
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Qalculate!:"
msgstr "गणना !:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:175
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Qalculate! is not your regular software replication of the cheapest "
"available calculator. Qalculate! aims to make full use of the superior "
"interface, power and flexibility of modern computers. The center of "
"attention in Qalculate! is the expression entry. Instead of entering each "
"number in a mathematical expression separately, you can directly write the "
"whole expression and later modify it. The interpretation of expressions is "
"flexible and fault tolerant, and if you nevertheless do something wrong, "
"Qalculate! will tell you so. Not fully solvable expressions are however not "
"errors. Qalculate! will simplify as far as it can and answer with an "
"expression. In addition to numbers and arithmetic operators, an expression "
"may contain any combination of variables, units, and functions. See <ulink "
"url=\"https://qalculate.github.io/\">https://qalculate.github.io/</ulink> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"गणना करो ! सस्तीतमस्य उपलब्धस्य गणकस्य भवतः नियमितं सॉफ्टवेयरप्रतिकृतिः "
"नास्ति । गणना करो ! आधुनिकसङ्गणकानां श्रेष्ठस्य अन्तरफलकस्य, शक्तिस्य, "
"लचीलतायाः च पूर्णतया उपयोगं कर्तुं उद्दिश्यते । Qalculate इत्यत्र ध्यानस्य "
"केन्द्रम्! इति व्यञ्जनप्रविष्टिः । गणितीयव्यञ्जने प्रत्येकं सङ्ख्यां पृथक् "
"प्रविश्य प्रत्यक्षतया सम्पूर्णं व्यञ्जनं लिखित्वा पश्चात् परिवर्तनं कर्तुं "
"शक्नुवन्ति । व्यञ्जनानां व्याख्या लचीला दोषसहिष्णुः च भवति, तथापि यदि भवान् "
"किमपि दुष्कृतं करोति तर्हि Qalculate! एवम् वक्ष्यति। न पूर्णतया "
"समाधानयोग्याः व्यञ्जनाः तथापि न दोषाः। गणना करो ! यथाशक्ति सरलं करिष्यति, "
"व्यञ्जनेन च उत्तरं दास्यति। संख्यानां, गणितीयसञ्चालकानां च अतिरिक्तं, "
"अभिव्यक्तिः चरानाम्, एककानां, कार्याणां च किमपि संयोजनं भवितुं शक्नोति । "
"अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://qalculate.github.io/\">https://qalculate.github.io/</ulink> "
"इति पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:192
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Python2 and Python3:"
msgstr "पायथन्२ तथा पायथन्३ : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:194
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Python is a remarkably powerful dynamic programming language that is used "
"in a wide variety of application domains. There are several Python packages "
"to scientific programming."
msgstr ""
"पायथन् एकः उल्लेखनीयरूपेण शक्तिशाली गतिशीलप्रोग्रामिंगभाषा अस्ति यस्य "
"उपयोगः विविधप्रयोगक्षेत्रेषु भवति । वैज्ञानिकप्रोग्रामिङ्गस्य अनेकाः "
"पायथन्-सङ्कुलाः सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:199
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Python is distributed under Python Software Foundation license (GPL "
"compatible). See the <ulink url=\"https://www.python.org/\">official "
"website</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"पायथन् पायथन् सॉफ्टवेयर फाउण्डेशन अनुज्ञापत्रस्य (GPL संगतस्य) अन्तर्गतं "
"वितरितम् अस्ति । अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.python.org/\">आधिकारिकजालस्थलं</ulink> पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:203
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This backend adds an additional item to the &cantor;'s main menu, "
"<guimenu>Package</guimenu>. The only item of this menu is "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Package</guimenu><guimenuitem>Import "
"Package</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This item can be used to import Python "
"packages to the worksheet."
msgstr ""
"एषः पृष्ठभागः &cantor; इत्यस्य मुख्यमेनूमध्ये अतिरिक्तं द्रव्यं योजयति, "
"<guimenu>Package</guimenu> । अस्य मेन्यू इत्यस्य एकमात्रं द्रव्यं "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>पैकेज</guimenu><guimenuitem>आयातपैकेज</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> अस्ति । एतत् द्रव्यं कार्यपत्रके Python संकुलानाम् आयाताय "
"उपयोक्तुं शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:210
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scilab:"
msgstr "स्किलाब् : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:212
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scilab is an free software, cross-platform numerical computational package "
"and a high-level, numerically oriented programming language."
msgstr ""
"Scilab एकः मुक्तसॉफ्टवेयरः, क्रॉस्-प्लेटफॉर्म संख्यात्मकगणनासंकुलः, "
"उच्चस्तरीयः, संख्यात्मकरूपेण उन्मुखः प्रोग्रामिंगभाषा च अस्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:216
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scilab is distributed under CeCILL license (GPL compatible). See <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.scilab.org/\">https://www.scilab.org/</ulink> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Scilab CeCILL अनुज्ञापत्रस्य (GPL संगतस्य) अन्तर्गतं वितरितं भवति । "
"अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.scilab.org/\">https://www.scilab.org/</ulink> इति "
"पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:220
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need Scilab version 5.5 or higher to be installed in your system to "
"make this backend usable."
msgstr ""
"एतत् पृष्ठभागं उपयोगयोग्यं कर्तुं भवतः प्रणाल्यां संस्थापनार्थं Scilab "
"संस्करणं 5.5 अथवा उच्चतरं आवश्यकम् ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:227
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Octave:"
msgstr "सप्तकः : १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:229
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&GNU; Octave is a high-level language, primarily intended for numerical "
"computations. It provides a convenient command line interface for solving "
"linear and nonlinear problems numerically, and for performing other "
"numerical experiments using a language that is mostly compatible with "
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://www.mathworks.com/products/matlab.html\">MATLAB</ulink>. See "
"<ulink url=\"https://octave.org/\">https://octave.org/</ulink> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"&GNU; अष्टकं उच्चस्तरीयभाषा अस्ति, मुख्यतया संख्यात्मकगणनायाः कृते "
"उद्दिष्टा । एतत् रेखीय-अरेखीय-समस्यानां संख्यात्मकरूपेण समाधानार्थं, "
"अन्येषां संख्यात्मकप्रयोगानाम् अपि कृते सुविधाजनकं आदेशपङ्क्ति-अन्तरफलकं "
"प्रदाति यत् अधिकतया <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.mathworks.com/products/matlab.html\" इत्यनेन सह "
"सङ्गतभाषायाः उपयोगेन भवति । >MATLAB</ulink> इति । अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://octave.org/\">https://octave.org/</ulink> इति पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:239
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lua:"
msgstr "द्वि:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lua is a fast and lightweight scripting language, with a simple procedural "
"syntax. There are several libraries in Lua aimed at math and science."
msgstr ""
"लुआ एकः द्रुतगतिः लघुः च लिपिभाषा अस्ति, यस्याः सरलप्रक्रियावाक्यविन्यासः "
"अस्ति । लुआ-नगरे गणितं विज्ञानं च लक्ष्यं कृत्वा अनेके पुस्तकालयाः सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:244
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See <ulink url=\"https://www.lua.org/\">https://www.lua.org/</ulink> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"अधिकविवरणार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.lua.org/\">https://www.lua.org/</ulink> इति पश्यन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:247
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This backend supports <ulink url=\"https://luajit.org/\">LuaJIT 2</ulink>."
msgstr "एषः पृष्ठभागः <ulink url=\"https://luajit.org/\">LuaJIT 2</ulink> समर्थयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:257
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &cantor; Workspace"
msgstr "&cantor; कार्यक्षेत्रम्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:260
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; Workspace</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; कार्यक्षेत्र</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:266
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; Workspace</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; कार्यक्षेत्र</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:271
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Worksheet interface of &cantor; consists of three parts:"
msgstr "&cantor इत्यस्य Worksheet अन्तरफलकं; त्रयः भागाः सन्ति- १."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:274
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tab bar, where you can switch through the open worksheets."
msgstr "ट्याब् बार, यत्र भवान् मुक्तकार्यपत्रकाणां माध्यमेन स्विच् कर्तुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:275
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A help panel, where help for a specific command is displayed if you enter "
"<userinput>?? <replaceable>command</replaceable></userinput>, "
"<userinput>describe(<replaceable>command</replaceable>)</userinput> or "
"<userinput>example(<replaceable>command</replaceable>)</userinput> "
"(<application>Maxima</application> backend)."
msgstr ""
"एकं सहायताफलकं, यत्र विशिष्टस्य आदेशस्य कृते सहायता प्रदर्शितं भवति यदि "
"भवान् <userinput>?? <replaceable>आदेशः</replaceable></userinput>, "
"<userinput>describe(<replaceable>आदेशः</replaceable>)</userinput> अथवा "
"<userinput>example(<replaceable>आदेशः</replaceable>)</userinput> "
"(<application>Maxima</application> पृष्ठभागः)।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:276
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Variable Manager panel where you can see the list of all available "
"variables on the current worksheet. The Help and Variable Manager panels "
"are shown as tabs on a sidebar of a &cantor; window. Variable manager can "
"be used for Maxima (if enabled on "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&cantor;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> <guilabel>Maxima</guilabel> page), "
"&kalgebra;, Octave, Python2, Python3, Qalculate, and Scilab backends only."
msgstr ""
"एकं Variable Manager फलकं यत्र भवान् वर्तमानकार्यपत्रे सर्वेषां "
"उपलब्धचरानाम् सूचीं द्रष्टुं शक्नोति । Help and Variable Manager इति पटलानि "
"&cantor; कोष्ठ। Maxima कृते चरप्रबन्धकस्य उपयोगः कर्तुं शक्यते (यदि "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem>विन्यस्तं कुर्वन्तु "
"&cantor;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> <guilabel>Maxima</guilabel> पृष्ठे "
"सक्षमम् अस्ति), &kalgebra;, Octave, Python2, Python3, Qalculate, Scilab च "
"पृष्ठभागाः एव ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:277
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The worksheet itself."
msgstr "कार्यपत्रकमेव ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:281
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Worksheet"
msgstr "कार्यपत्रकम्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:282
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The worksheet is the basic area for working with &cantor;. Using it, you "
"can enter expressions, allow the backend to perform calculations, and look "
"at the results. The commands the worksheets accept depend on the chosen "
"backend, so you should learn the appropriate backend syntax (the "
"<guibutton>Show Help</guibutton> button takes you there directly). If you "
"know the command, but you need additional information, you can type \"? "
"<replaceable>command</replaceable>\", and contextual help will appear on "
"the right of the worksheet. If you want to see some example worksheets, you "
"can go to <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Download Example "
"Worksheets</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item, and download worksheets "
"other users have published."
msgstr ""
"कार्यपत्रकं &cantor;सहकार्यस्य मूलक्षेत्रम् अस्ति । तस्य उपयोगेन भवान् "
"व्यञ्जनानि प्रविष्टुं शक्नोति, पृष्ठभागं गणनां कर्तुं अनुमन्यते, परिणामान् "
"च पश्यति । कार्यपत्रकाः ये आदेशाः स्वीकुर्वन्ति ते चयनितपृष्ठभागस्य उपरि "
"निर्भराः सन्ति, अतः भवद्भिः समुचितं पृष्ठभागवाक्यविन्यासः ज्ञातव्यः "
"(<guibutton>Show Help</guibutton> बटन् भवन्तं प्रत्यक्षतया तत्र नयति) । यदि "
"भवान् आदेशं जानाति, परन्तु अतिरिक्तसूचना आवश्यकी अस्ति तर्हि भवान् \"? "
"<replaceable>command</replaceable>\" इति टङ्कयितुं शक्नोति, ततः "
"कार्यपत्रकस्य दक्षिणभागे सन्दर्भसहायता दृश्यते । यदि भवान् कानिचन "
"उदाहरणकार्यपत्राणि द्रष्टुम् इच्छति तर्हि "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu><guimenuitem>उदाहरणकार्यपत्राणि "
"डाउनलोड् कुर्वन्तु</guimenuitem></menuchoice> मेनू-वस्तुं गत्वा, अन्यैः "
"उपयोक्तृभिः प्रकाशितानि कार्यपत्राणि डाउनलोड् कर्तुं च शक्नोति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:291
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To control each command entry of the worksheet you can use control buttons "
"shown at the right part of the worksheet when hovering the entry field with "
"a mouse cursor. There are three basic actions for each entry: "
"<guilabel>Evaluate Entry</guilabel> to update the result of calculations "
"for the entry, <guilabel>Drag Entry</guilabel> to move the entry at the "
"other place of the current worksheet and <guilabel>Remove Entry</guilabel> "
"to remove the entry from the current worksheet."
msgstr ""
"कार्यपत्रकस्य प्रत्येकं आदेशप्रविष्टिं नियन्त्रयितुं भवान् कार्यपत्रकस्य "
"दक्षिणभागे दर्शितानां नियन्त्रणबटनानाम् उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोति यदा "
"प्रविष्टिक्षेत्रं मूषकस्य कर्सरेन भ्रमति । प्रत्येकस्य प्रविष्टेः कृते "
"त्रीणि मूलभूतक्रियाः सन्ति: <guilabel>प्रविष्टेः मूल्याङ्कनं "
"कुरुत</guilabel> प्रविष्टेः कृते गणनाफलं अद्यतनीकर्तुं, "
"<guilabel>प्रविष्टिं कर्षयन्तु</guilabel> वर्तमानकार्यपत्रकस्य अन्यस्मिन् "
"स्थाने प्रविष्टिं स्थानान्तरयितुं तथा च <guilabel>प्रविष्टिं "
"निष्कासयतु</guilabel> वर्तमानकार्यपत्रकात् प्रविष्टिं निष्कासयितुं ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:294
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Font settings and alignment of worksheet entries can be changed using a "
"toolbar above the worksheet."
msgstr ""
"कार्यपत्रकस्य उपरि टूलबारस्य उपयोगेन कार्यपत्रकप्रविष्टीनां फन्ट् "
"सेटिंग्स्, संरेखणं च परिवर्तयितुं शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:298
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "सेटिंग्स्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:299
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu allows you to change some settings of "
"the appearance of your current worksheet."
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> मेन्यू भवन्तं वर्तमानकार्यपत्रस्य स्वरूपस्य "
"केचन सेटिङ्ग्स् परिवर्तयितुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:305
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Typeset using LaTeX"
msgstr "LaTeX इत्यस्य उपयोगेन टङ्कणसेट् कुर्वन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:307
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting changes the way results are presented to you. If enabled, it "
"passes the result through the &latex; system, to produce visually appealing "
"formulas. For example, <quote>3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3</quote> becomes"
msgstr ""
"एतेन सेटिङ्ग् भवतः समक्षं परिणामानां प्रस्तुतीकरणस्य मार्गं परिवर्तयति । "
"यदि सक्षमं भवति तर्हि &latex; प्रणाली, दृग्गतरूपेण आकर्षकसूत्राणि "
"उत्पादयितुं । यथा <quote>3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3</quote> भवति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:314
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "3*x^2*sqrt(2)*x+2/3"
msgstr "3 * x ^ 2 * वर्ग (2) * x + 2 / 3"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:320
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Syntax Highlighting"
msgstr "वाक्य रचना प्रकाशनम्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:322
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Syntax Highlighting increases the readability of code, by highlighting "
"keywords, or matching brackets in different colors."
msgstr ""
"वाक्यविन्यासः हाइलाइटिङ्ग् इत्यनेन कोडस्य पठनीयता वर्धते, कीवर्ड् हाइलाइट् "
"कृत्वा, अथवा भिन्नवर्णेषु कोष्ठकानां मेलनं कृत्वा ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:329
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Completion"
msgstr "समाप्ति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:331
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this is enabled, &cantor; will show you possible completions for the "
"command you are currently typing when you press the Tab-key. If there is "
"only one choice remaining, it will insert the rest of the command for you."
msgstr ""
"यदा एतत् सक्षमं भवति तदा &cantor; यदा भवान् Tab-key नुदति तदा भवान् "
"सम्प्रति टङ्कयति तस्य आदेशस्य सम्भाव्यसमाप्तिः दर्शयिष्यति । यदि एकः एव "
"विकल्पः अवशिष्टः अस्ति तर्हि भवतः कृते शेषं आदेशं निवेशयिष्यति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:339
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line Numbers"
msgstr "रेखासङ्ख्याः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:341
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting controls whether the different expressions should have a "
"number in front. This allows you to recall older results - in Maxima, for "
"instance, this is done with the <quote>%O1</quote> command."
msgstr ""
"एतत् सेटिङ्ग् नियन्त्रयति यत् भिन्नभिन्नव्यञ्जनानां पुरतः सङ्ख्या "
"भवितुमर्हति वा इति । एतेन भवन्तः प्राचीनपरिणामान् स्मर्तुं शक्नुवन्ति - "
"उदाहरणार्थं Maxima मध्ये एतत् <quote>%O1</quote> आदेशेन क्रियते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:348
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Animate Worksheet"
msgstr "कार्यपत्रकं सजीवं कुर्वन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:350
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting controls whether the different animations will be used to "
"highlight changes on a worksheet."
msgstr ""
"एषा सेटिङ्ग् कार्यपत्रके परिवर्तनं प्रकाशयितुं भिन्नानि एनिमेशन्स् "
"उपयुज्यन्ते वा इति नियन्त्रयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:356
#. Tag: term
#, no-c-format
msgid "Embedded Math"
msgstr "एम्बेडेड गणित"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:358
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This setting controls whether rendering math expressions inside "
"<literal>$$..$$</literal> in Text and &Markdown; entries is enabled by "
"default (needs <application>pdflatex</application> installed)."
msgstr ""
"एषा सेटिङ्ग् नियन्त्रयति यत् Text तथा &Markdown; प्रविष्टयः "
"पूर्वनिर्धारितरूपेण सक्षमाः सन्ति (<application>pdflatex</application> "
"संस्थापनस्य आवश्यकता अस्ति) ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:368
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The assistant dialogs"
msgstr "सहायकः संवादं करोति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:369
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are several assistant dialogs implemented in &cantor; to alleviate "
"some basic operations."
msgstr "&cantor; केषाञ्चन मूलभूतक्रियाणां उपशमनार्थं।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:372
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These dialogs can be accessed using the main menu items. Each backend has "
"its own assistant dialogs."
msgstr ""
"एते संवादाः मुख्यमेनू-वस्तूनाम् उपयोगेन अभिगन्तुं शक्यन्ते । प्रत्येकं "
"पृष्ठभागस्य स्वकीयाः सहायकसंवादाः सन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:376
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Create Matrix dialog"
msgstr "Create Matrix इति संवादः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:378
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; matrix creation dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; आकृतिनिर्माणसंवादः</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:384
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; matrix creation dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; आकृतिनिर्माणसंवादः</phrase>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:388
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog can be used to input matrices. You can define matrix dimensions "
"and its elements."
msgstr ""
"एतत् संवादं मैट्रिक्स-निवेशनार्थं उपयोक्तुं शक्यते । भवन्तः matrix "
"dimensions तस्य एलिमेण्ट् च परिभाषितुं शक्नुवन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:391
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to navigate between cells quickly during input using the "
"&Tab; key."
msgstr "&Tab; कुंजी।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:396
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Matrix operation dialog"
msgstr "मैट्रिक्स संचालन संवाद"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:398
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; matrix input dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; matrix input dialog</screeninfo> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:404
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; matrix input dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; matrix input dialog</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:408
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering name of the matrix to compute its eigenvectors, "
"eigenvalues or invert matrix. The default value (<userinput>%</userinput>) "
"is used to refer to the previous result of calculation or input."
msgstr ""
"एषः संवादः तस्य eigenvectors, eigenvalues अथवा invert matrix इत्यस्य गणनां "
"कर्तुं matrix इत्यस्य नाम प्रविष्टुं शक्नोति । पूर्वनिर्धारितं मूल्यं "
"(<userinput>%</userinput>) गणनायाः अथवा निवेशस्य पूर्वफलस्य सन्दर्भार्थं "
"उपयुज्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:413
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Differentiation dialog"
msgstr "भेदसंवादः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:415
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; differentiation dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; भेदसंवादः</screeninfo> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:421
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; differentiation dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; भेदसंवाद</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:425
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering expression of the function to differentiate, "
"the name of the variable and the order of derivative."
msgstr ""
"अयं संवादः भेदं कर्तुं फंक्शन् इत्यस्य अभिव्यक्तिं, चरस्य नाम, "
"व्युत्पन्नस्य क्रमं च प्रविष्टुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:430
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integration dialog"
msgstr "एकीकरणसंवादः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:432
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; integration dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; एकीकरणसंवादः</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:438
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; integration dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; एकीकरणसंवाद</phrase>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:442
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering expression of the function to integrate, the "
"name of the variable and the limits of integration (for the definite "
"integral)."
msgstr ""
"अयं संवादः एकीकृत्य कार्यस्य अभिव्यक्तिं, चरस्य नाम, एकीकरणस्य सीमाः च "
"(निश्चित अभिन्नस्य कृते) प्रविष्टुं अनुमतिं ददाति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:447
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Solve equations dialog"
msgstr "समीकरणसंवादस्य समाधानं कुर्वन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:449
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; solve equation dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; समीकरणसंवादं समाधानं</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:455
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; solve equation dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; solve equation dialog</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:459
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering equations to solve (each equation in a separate "
"line) and the variables to determine (separated by the comma)."
msgstr ""
"अयं संवादः समीकरणानां समाधानार्थं (प्रत्येकं समीकरणं पृथक् रेखायां) तथा च "
"चरानाम् निर्धारणाय (अल्पविरामेन पृथक्कृताः) प्रविष्टुं अनुमतिं ददाति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:464
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Package import dialog"
msgstr "संकुल आयातसंवादः"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:466
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; package import dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; संकुल आयातसंवादः</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:472
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; package import dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; संकुल आयातसंवादः</phrase>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:476
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering name of the package to import (&eg; "
"<userinput>numpy</userinput> for Python)."
msgstr ""
"एषः संवादः आयातार्थं संकुलस्य नाम प्रविष्टुं शक्नोति (&eg; "
"<userinput>numpy</userinput> पायथन् कृते) ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:481
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plot dialog"
msgstr "प्लॉट संवाद"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:483
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot dialog (Functions "
"tab)</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; plot dialog (Functions tab)</screeninfo> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:489
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot dialog (Functions tab)</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; plot dialog (Functions tab)</phrase> "
"इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:493
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The options of this dialog are separated into two groups using tabs. The "
"<guilabel>Functions</guilabel> tab allows entering functions to plot."
msgstr ""
"अस्य संवादस्य विकल्पाः ट्याब्स् इत्यस्य उपयोगेन द्वयोः समूहयोः विभक्ताः "
"सन्ति । <guilabel>Functions</guilabel> ट्याब् इत्यनेन फंक्शन्स् प्रविष्टुं "
"प्लॉट् कर्तुं शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:496
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter new function click on the <guibutton>Add</guibutton>. Double-click "
"on the <guilabel>Title</guilabel> cell and enter the title, then "
"double-click on the <guilabel>Expression</guilabel> cell and enter the "
"function expression."
msgstr ""
"नूतनं कार्यं प्रविष्टुं <guibutton>Add</guibutton> इत्यत्र नुदन्तु । "
"<guilabel>Title</guilabel> कोष्ठके द्विवारं क्लिक् कृत्वा शीर्षकं "
"प्रविशन्तु, ततः <guilabel>Expression</guilabel> कोष्ठके द्विवारं क्लिक् "
"कृत्वा function expression प्रविशन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:500
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot dialog (Options "
"tab)</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; plot dialog (Options tab)</screeninfo> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:506
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot dialog (Options tab)</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; plot dialog (Options tab)</phrase> इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:510
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Options</guilabel> tab is used to define plot and legend "
"options. You can fine-tune almost every plot option to obtain the pleasant "
"look of your figure."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>विकल्पाः</guilabel> ट्याब् प्लॉट् तथा लेजेण्ड् विकल्पान् "
"परिभाषितुं उपयुज्यते । भवन्तः स्वस्य आकृतिस्य सुखदरूपं प्राप्तुं प्रायः "
"प्रत्येकं कथानकविकल्पं सूक्ष्मरूपेण स्थापयितुं शक्नुवन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:515
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plot 2D dialog"
msgstr "प्लॉट 2D संवाद"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:517
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot 2D dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; प्लॉट् 2D संवाद</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:523
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot 2D dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; प्लॉट 2D संवाद</phrase>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:527
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering expression of the function, its variable and "
"the limits for this variable."
msgstr ""
"अयं संवादः फंक्शन् इत्यस्य अभिव्यक्तिं, तस्य चरस्य, अस्य चरस्य सीमां च "
"प्रविष्टुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:532
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plot 3D dialog"
msgstr "प्लॉट 3D संवाद"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:534
#. Tag: screeninfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot 3D dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&cantor; प्लॉट् 3D संवाद</screeninfo>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:540
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the &cantor; plot 3D dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>स्क्रीनशॉट् इत्यस्य &cantor; प्लॉट् 3D संवाद</phrase>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:544
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows entering expression of the function, its variables and "
"the limits for each variable."
msgstr ""
"अयं संवादः फंक्शन् इत्यस्य अभिव्यक्तिं, तस्य चरानाम्, प्रत्येकस्य चरस्य "
"सीमां च प्रविष्टुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:552
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Reference"
msgstr "आदेश सन्दर्भ"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:555
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main &cantor; window"
msgstr "मुख्यः &cantor; कोष्ठ"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:557
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cantor; has the common &kde; menu items, for more information read the "
"<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html\">Menu</ulink> chapter of the "
"&kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr "&cantor; सामान्यं &kde; मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं &kde; मौलिकता।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:561
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Below is the list of the additional or special menu items in &cantor;. "
"Please note that some menus are only shown for backends that have "
"corresponding implementation."
msgstr ""
"अधः &cantor;मध्ये अतिरिक्तस्य अथवा विशेषस्य मेनू-वस्तूनाम् सूची अस्ति । "
"कृपया ज्ञातव्यं यत् केचन मेनू केवलं तेषां पृष्ठभागानाम् कृते दर्शिताः सन्ति "
"येषां तत्सम्बद्धं कार्यान्वयनम् अस्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:565
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The File Menu"
msgstr "सञ्चिकामेनू इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:569
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> <guimenuitem>नवीन</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:576
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates a new worksheet with the default backend."
msgstr "पूर्वनिर्धारितपृष्ठभागेन सह नूतनं कार्यपत्रकं निर्माति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:579
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>New</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem><replaceable>Backend</replaceable></guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> <guisubmenu>नवीन</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem><replaceable>पृष्ठभूमिः</replaceable></guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:584
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates a new worksheet with the chosen backend."
msgstr "चयनितपृष्ठभागेन सह नूतनं कार्यपत्रकं निर्माति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:587
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>उद्घाट्य...</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:594
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open a supported new worksheet with the file dialog."
msgstr "सञ्चिकासंवादेन सह समर्थितं नूतनं कार्यपत्रकं उद्घाटयन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:597
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<menu>सञ्चिका</menu> <menu>अद्यतनं</menu> उद्घाटयन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:601
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose a worksheet from a list of recently used files."
msgstr "सद्यः प्रयुक्तानां सञ्चिकानां सूचीतः कार्यपत्रकं चिनोतु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:604
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Download Example "
"Worksheets</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उदाहरणकार्यपत्राणि डाउनलोड् "
"कुर्वन्तु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:608
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens the dialog to download examples uploaded by other &cantor; users with "
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:MyLanguage/Glossary#Get_Hot_New_"
"Stuff\">GetHotNewStuff</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"अन्यैः अपलोड् कृतानि उदाहरणानि डाउनलोड् कर्तुं संवादं उद्घाटयति &cantor; "
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://userbase.kde.org/Special:MyLanguage/Glossary#Get_Hot_New_"
"Stuff\">GetHotNewStuff</ulink> इत्यनेन सह उपयोक्तारः ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:612
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open Example</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उदाहरणं उद्घाटयन्तु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:616
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Opens the dialog to choose an example to load.</action> The "
"examples should be downloaded with <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Download Example Worksheets</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"beforehand."
msgstr ""
"<action>लोड् कर्तुं उदाहरणं चिन्वितुं संवादं उद्घाटयति।</action> उदाहरणानि "
"पूर्वं <menuchoice><guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>उदाहरणकार्यपत्राणि डाउनलोड् "
"कुर्वन्तु</guimenuitem></menuchoice> इत्यनेन सह अवतरणं कर्तव्यम्"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:620
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save Plain Text</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> <guimenuitem>सादा पाठं रक्षतु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:624
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows saving the current worksheet as a plain text document."
msgstr "वर्तमानकार्यपत्रकं साधारणपाठदस्तावेजरूपेण रक्षितुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:627
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Export to LaTeX</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सञ्चिका</guimenu> <guimenuitem>LaTeX</guimenuitem> मध्ये निर्यातं "
"कुर्वन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:631
