"पृष्ठभागः न दृश्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:957
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One possible explanation is that &cantor; did not correctly detect the "
"location. Go to the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&cantor;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> dialog and change the "
"<guilabel>Path</guilabel> to the appropriate application on the backend's "
"page."
msgstr ""
"एकं सम्भाव्यं व्याख्यानं अस्ति यत् &cantor; स्थानं सम्यक् न ज्ञातवान्। "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
"&cantor;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> संवादं गत्वा "
"<guilabel>Path</guilabel> इत्येतत् पृष्ठभागस्य समुचिते अनुप्रयोगे "
"परिवर्तयन्तु पृष्ठ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:964
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "What a peculiar name - what does it have to do with mathematics?"
