# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:965
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cantor; is named after the German mathematician <ulink "
"url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georg_Cantor\">Georg Cantor</ulink>, "
"the creator of set theory."
msgstr ""
"&cantor; समुच्चयसिद्धान्तस्य निर्माता जर्मनगणितज्ञस्य <ulink "
"url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georg_Cantor\">जॉर्ज कैण्टर्</ulink> "
"इत्यस्य नामधेयेन निर्मितम् अस्ति ।"

